{"id":"n56774-1-8","stage":2,"title":"반대쪽 · 反方向","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56774-1-8-1","ko":"민준아! 왜 반대쪽으로 가는 거야?","zh":"敏俊啊！你为什么要往反方向走？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아!","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"반대쪽으로","meaning":"反方向，反面","explanation":"반대쪽：反方向，反面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"반대쪽","audio":"/audio/81a8b1a6acc2b483e06e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56774","senseId":"1","lemma":"반대쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반대쪽으로","audio":"/audio/09e9e3ef8c03ec05d45b.mp3"}},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는","audio":"/audio/4df15b29e7ed7afe1cce.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"是……吗？（询问事情或情况）","explanation":"거：某种事情、情况；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"81a8b1a6acc2b483","term":"반대쪽","zh":"反方向，反面","audio":"/audio/81a8b1a6acc2b483e06e.m